  "id": "execution.crash-before-dispatch-recovers-under-same-identity",
  "version": 1,
  "title": "A crash before the dispatch marker lets recovery resume the same delivery once, record the decision and fence the old host generation; a retransmitted submit replays the original acknowledgment",
